is: meaning-codes.bml lists 36 symbols; each has an English phrase, a node code (8 hex digits of SHA-256 of the symbol's spelling) and one code per language column of three row files (8, 20 and 1 rows), joined by the English phrase. mc-resolve-all returns every symbol with a code; the band pins one collision: a Persian word resolves to say and tell.
