n: 3.10.8
name: keep
kind: hub
is: Eight things to carry forward: a sentence meaning as a composite with a numeric category and concept nodes as children; a language as data in both directions; a word as a lens entry with context and provenance; zero-to-many candidates from text and rendering from a chosen concept; a claim state on every attachment with reviewed starting at zero; recorded residue and explicit gap cells; definitions checked for closure and depth by checks shown able to fail; settledness as a state of the binding.
at: 2026-11-24
by: r2/gap-natural-language-lane

n: 3.10.8.1
name: sentence-as-composite
kind: finding
is: Keep the shape of the old pivot: a sentence meaning is a composite node whose category is a numeric blueprint and whose identity comes from its children. Change the content: the children are concept nodes, not label strings. The old translator has the shape (category 1.2.99.33, two children) and label strings as the children.
status: inferred
conf: high
from: 3.10.1.3 3.10.1.7 1.3
at: 2026-11-24
by: r2/gap-natural-language-lane

n: 3.10.8.2
name: language-as-data-both-ways
kind: finding
is: A language enters as data over one engine in both directions: the rule that turns a node into text is data, as the grammar that parses text is. The old translator has the parsing half only; its decoders are code per language, so adding a language or a second construction is a programming task.
status: inferred
conf: high
from: 3.10.1.1 3.10.1.8
at: 2026-11-24
by: r2/gap-natural-language-lane

